<h3><u>Aye alamdar e man</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>ya Abbas a.s (10)</p>

<p>Aey Alamdar e man Aey Sipah dar e man(2)<br />
Aey wafadar e man Aa<br />
Main hogaya tanha<br />
Ya Abbas a.s(3)</p>

<p>1. Waqt e madad hai ba wafaa<br />
darya pe ab sota hai kya<br />
Halmin ki deta hu sada<br />
sun aey Sakina a.s ke chacha<br />
aey mere bawafaa aey mere dilruba aey mere mehlaqaan Aa<br />
Main Hogya Tanha Ya Abbas a.s (3)</p>

<p>2.&nbsp; Aa dekh meri zindagi<br />
Dard o alam main ghir gayi<br />
zakhmi huwa rah war bhi<br />
barhne lagi hai tishnagi<br />
Tunay rakha bharam Har ghadi har qadam Phir uthalay Alam Aa<br />
main hogaya tanha ya Abbas a.s (3)</p>

<p>3. Laashain utha kar thak gaya<br />
Pucho na kese ghar gaya<br />
Abbas phir main gir gaya<br />
Samjhi Behn main mar gaya<br />
haye kiya reh gaya hogayi inteha jaane Mushkil Kasha Aa<br />
main hogaya tanha Ya Abbas a.s (3)</p>

<p>4. Bhaya mujhay yeh hai khabar<br />
Be dast tu hai khaak par<br />
Phir bhi magar koshish to kar<br />
Aja tarayi chod kar Tere baazoo qalam khoon main dooba Alam Hai Sakina a.s ko gham Aa<br />
mai hogya tanha Ya Abbas (3)</p>

<p>5. Khanjar talay hai sar mera<br />
zaalim hai seenay par charha<br />
thi Sarwar o Rehan yeh<br />
Mola e be Qas a.s ki sada<br />
Aa mere bhai Aa Kat raha hai gala Aakhri hai sada Aa<br />
main hogaya tanha ya Abbas a.s (3)</p>

<p>Aey Alamdar e man Aey Sipah dar e man Aey wafadar e man Aa Main hogaya tanha Ya Abbas a.s(10)</p>
</p>
    
